<title>LITHUANIA: CURRENCY FIXINGS FOR AUG 7/8.</title>
<headline>CURRENCY FIXINGS FOR AUG 7/8.</headline>
<dateline>VILNIUS 1997-08-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Lithuania on Thursday</p>
<p>set the following currency fixings for August 8. The litas is</p>
<p>pegged to the U.S. dollar at a rate of four to one.</p>
<p>		   07.08.97	  06.08.97</p>
<p>    USD	  4.0000	    4.0000</p>
<p>    GBP	  6.3938	    6.4156</p>
<p>    DEM	  2.1260	    2.1195</p>
<p>    ECU	  4.1864	    4.1814</p>
<p>    100JPY     3.3713	    3.3561</p>
<p>    SEK	  0.4945	    0.4937</p>
<p>    FIM	  0.7133	    0.7117</p>
<p>    EEK	  0.2657	    0.2650</p>
<p>    LAT	  6.7278	    6.6834</p>
<p>    1000RUR    0.6886	    0.6889</p>
<p>    PLN	  1.1396	    1.1450</p>
<p>-- Vilnius newsroom +370 2 22 35 17</p>
